{
  "description": "A column joined into a housing's channel, standing on its floor and along its curved wall (the last step), failed with `Union: no result`: the join ran the tool on 0.6 mm into the floor so the boolean would meet no touching faces, and that run-on tool defeated the boolean, while the column as drawn, made as a new body and combined, joins. A join extrude now retries with its tools as drawn.",
